        "created_at": "2012-12-04T14:26:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"arenson9\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/48/1900_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> arenson9:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I was surprised at how poorly I did at some of the other quizes. <em>grump</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'm not. I'm usually pretty good with card names, but in Sentinels I find the effect to be far more memorable. If it were possible for the quizzes to be inverted* I'd do much better.</p>\n<p>*This would probably require using the \"clickable\" quiz form, and it would still be ugly.</p>",
