      {
        "id": 45193,
        "name": "Katsue",
        "username": "Katsue",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/katsue/{size}/2012_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-12-05T00:18:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ameena\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/48/1907_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ameena:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>How do you mean, \"inverted\"?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Inverted means upside down or the other way around. So in this case, it means here's the name, type in the card text. Personally, if I wasn't so lazy, I'd do a quiz where you have to guess the card names from the flavour text.</p>",
