        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/vyolynce/{size}/2397_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-12-05T04:11:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Katsue\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/katsue/48/2012_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Katsue:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Ameena wrote:</b><br><blockquote>How do you mean, \"inverted\"?\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nInverted means upside down or the other way around. So in this case, it means here's the name, type in the card text.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Basically. Although like I said, that would probably be easier (only possible) as a clickable.</p>",
