      {
        "id": 45196,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-12-05T21:16:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I know what the word \"inverted\" actually means, I just didn't understand your application of it in relation to my quizzes ;). But yeah, a quiz in which you had to type out the descriptive text would be somewhat more difficult. As you say, probably better as a clicky. Who's gonna remember the <span class=\"bbcode-i\">exact</span> way each card effect is written in order to type it out in the quiz? Now <span class=\"bbcode-i\">that</span> would be one for the hardcore players ;).</p>\n<p>Haven't got round to doing more quizzes this last couple of nights - been busy. Hopefully I'll get some more done soon :).</p>",
